msgid "<0>Estimate modelled by OpenAlex</0> (all publishers): journal list price, or amount paid when known. OpenAlex <1>does not indicate who paid the fees</1> — an overview with no certainty about the payer or the actual spending (see the other sub-tabs for ground truth). Amounts converted to euros (foreign currencies converted from USD at ~€0.92)."
